stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UDPCtx : Wake up (RTC alarm · next_wake)

    UDPCtx : UDP context<br/>(activate PDP + open socket)
    Announce : IP announce<br/>(AT+CGPADDR → ANNOUNCE_IP<br/>if IP changed · opens NAT pinhole)

    state Exchange {
        [*] --> Waiting
        Waiting : Wait for HES message<br/>(poll QIRD)
        Disp : Read and dispatch<br/>by MsgType
        Waiting --> Disp : data available
        Disp --> Waiting : HANDSHAKE→resp (sync RTC)<br/>READ→OBIS values<br/>WRITE→next_wake + resp
    }

    UDPCtx --> Announce : socket open
    Announce --> Exchange : IP announced
    Disp --> Done : HES ACK

    UDPCtx --> Backoff : error
    Announce --> Backoff : error / timeout
    Exchange --> Backoff : error / timeout

    Done : Session complete<br/>(reset pulse counter · power modem off)
    Backoff : Exponential backoff
    Backoff --> UDPCtx : retry (increasing wait)
    Backoff --> ResetMCU : N consecutive failures

    Done --> [*]
    ResetMCU : MCU reset
    ResetMCU --> [*]
